add(325,'minchah_navigation','en','Then the congregation says the תפלה page 44. (On Sabbath, however, ואני תפלתי is said. Then a scroll of the Torah is taken out and the following passage from האזינו is read. After the scroll has been returned to the ארון הקדש, the reader says half Kaddish and the congregation says the prayer on page 44.) The reader repeats the תפלה aloud together with the קדשה. It is followed by אבינו מלכנו (but not on the Sabbath) on page 67, קדיש תתקבל, עלינו and קדיש יתום.','instruction')
